          codeBlock: "# llama.cpp: split layers evenly across two GPUs\nllama-server -m llama-3.3-70b-instruct-Q4_K_M.gguf -ngl 99 --tensor-split 1,1\n\n# vLLM: tensor parallelism across two GPUs (4-bit AWQ checkpoint)\nvllm serve casperhansen/llama-3.3-70b-instruct-awq \\\n  --quantization awq --tensor-parallel-size 2 --max-model-len 8192\n\n# Check both cards, then cap board power (example value)\nnvidia-smi\nsudo nvidia-smi -pl 300",
